<slide>
  --move-dur: 0s
  --fade-dur: 0s
</slide>

## Instant

`--move-dur: 0s` and `--fade-dur: 0s`: frames switch with no animation at all.
(Visitors who ask the OS for reduced motion get this automatically.)

<code lang=typescript id=g1>
  <frame>
    const mode = "instant";
  </frame>
  <frame>
    const mode = "instant";
    const delay = 0;
  </frame>
</code>
